color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Rock 'n' roll umlaut.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1b/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212034350\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Rock &#39;n&#39; roll umlaut.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1b/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034350\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1b/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034350 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1b/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212034350 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Rock &#39;n&#39; roll umlaut.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut..png\" data-image-name=\"Rock &#39;n&#39; roll umlaut..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">8</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\">Sian Gibson</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stay_humble.\" title=\"Stay humble.\">Stay humble.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/This_is_Trevor.\" title=\"This is Trevor.\">This is Trevor.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Rock 'n' roll umlaut.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">Series 8</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 12 June 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\">Sian Gibson</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Rock ‘n’ roll umlaut\" was a phrase used by <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\">Joe Thomas</a> to describe his team's choice of band name character decoration, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Design_the_most_iconic_album_cover\" title=\"Design the most iconic album cover\">Design the most iconic album cover</a> task. The cards used for the <a href=\"/wiki/Tell_Alex_the_order_that_the_cards_are_currently_in\" title=\"Tell Alex the order that the cards are currently in\">Tell Alex the order that the cards are currently in</a> are used for the title card.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Rock and roll-umlaut'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Rock 'n' roll-umlaut', which translates as 'Rock 'n' roll umlaut'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Rock 'n' roll-tødler', which translates as 'Rock 'n' roll umlaut'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Iain Stirling</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Thomas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lou Sanders</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Sinha</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sian Gibson</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_see-through_item\" title=\"Best see-through item\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best see-through item.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Completely_conceal_yourself_inside_this_phone_box\" title=\"Completely conceal yourself inside this phone box\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Completely conceal yourself in this phone box. No part of you or your clothing may be visible from outside the phone box.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Design_the_most_iconic_album_cover\" title=\"Design the most iconic album cover\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Design the most iconic album cover.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tell_Alex_the_order_that_the_cards_are_currently_in\" title=\"Tell Alex the order that the cards are currently in\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>In five minutes, you must return this pack of cards to Alex in the lab and tell Alex the order that the cards are currently in. You may not leave this room during the five minutes.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Score_a_goal_from_the_furthest_distance\" title=\"Score a goal from the furthest distance\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Score a goal from the furthest distance. You may take only one shot. If you don't score a goal, you're disqualified. You must perform a terrific goal celebration whether or not you score a goal.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Best goal celebration.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roll_your_loo_roll_beyond_the_second_line\" title=\"Roll your loo roll beyond the second line\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Standing behind the first line, roll your loo roll beyond the second line. If your loo roll fails to cross the second line or falls from the runway, you are eliminated from the task.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Retrieve your shoe. You may not cross the line in front of you. If your shoe falls off your loo roll, or your loo roll breaks, you are eliminated from the task.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_8,_Episode_6_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/40/Taskmaster_-_Series_8%2C_Episode_6_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003949\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_8,_Episode_6_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Rock_&#39;n&#39;_roll_umlaut&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_8,_Episode_6_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Rock_&#39;n&#39;_roll_umlaut&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 8, Episode 6 - Full Episode - &#39;Rock &#39;n&#39; roll umlaut&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This episode marks the final time an episode would regularly have six filmed tasks. Starting from <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">Series 9</a>, episodes have five tasks an episode, with three filmed tasks. It would be the penultimate time overall, with <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/I_hate_your_trainers.\" title=\"I hate your trainers.\">I hate your trainers.</a></span> being the final.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/rock-%E2%80%98n%E2%80%99-roll-umlaut\"><i>Rock 'n' roll umlaut.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/71677-006\"><i>Rock 'n' roll umlaut.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached 